hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1464","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo ghulam mein apna hissa azad kare aur us ke paas maal ho jo ghulam ki qeemat tak pahunche to us par adl ki qeemat lagai jae gi aur wo apne shareekon ko un ke hisse de aur ghulam us par azad ho jaega, warna is mein se jo azad hua azad hua."
"1465","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se aur aik se zyada se, Hasan Basri ke bete Hasan se aur Sireen ke bete Muhammad se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein aik mard ne apni maut ke waqt apne chhe ghulam azad kiye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un ke darmiyan qura dala aur un ghulamon ka tihai azad kya. Malik ne kaha ke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke us mard ka un ke ilawa maal na tha."
"1466","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se riwayat kya ke Usman ke bete Aban ki hukumat mein aik mard ne apne tamam ghulam azad kiye jabke us ka un ke ilawa maal na tha, to Usman ke bete Aban ne un ghulamon ka hukm diya aur wo teen hisson mein taqseem kiye gae phir qura dala gaya ke murde ka teer kin par nikle aur wo azad hon, to teer teen hisson mein se aik par pada aur wo tihai azad hua jis par teer pada tha."
"1467","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein kehte suna ke sunnat guzar chuki hai ke ghulam jab azad ho to us ka maal us ke peechhe hota hai. Malik ne kaha ke is mein se jo wazeh karta hai ke ghulam jab azad ho to us ka maal us ke peechhe hota hai ye hai ke mukatab jab kitabat kare to us ka maal us ke peechhe hota hai agarche us ne shart na rakhi ho, aur is ki wajah ye hai ke kitabat ka aqd wala ka aqd hai jab ye poora ho, aur ghulam aur mukatab ka maal un ki aulad ke manzilay mein nahi, balke in dono ki aulad in dono ki gardanon ke manzilay mein hai, in dono ke maal ke manzilay mein nahi kyunke wo sunnat jis mein koi ikhtilaf nahi ke ghulam jab azad ho to us ka maal us ke peechhe hota hai aur us ki aulad us ke peechhe nahi hoti, aur mukatab jab kitabat kare to us ka maal us ke peechhe hota hai aur us ki aulad us ke peechhe nahi hoti. Malik ne kaha ke is mein se jo ye bhi wazeh karta hai ke ghulam aur mukatab jab muflis hon to un ke maal aur un ki Ummahat Walad liye jaein aur un ki aulad na li jaein kyunke wo in dono ke maal nahi. Malik ne kaha ke is mein se jo ye bhi wazeh karta hai ke ghulam jab becha jae aur jo use khareede us ka maal shart rakhe to us ki aulad us ke maal mein dakhil na hogi. Malik ne kaha ke is mein se jo ye bhi wazeh karta hai ke ghulam jab zakhmi ho to wo aur us ka maal liya jaega aur us ki aulad na li jaegi."
"1468","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jo waleeda apne aaqa se bacha jane to wo use na bechega aur na bakhshega aur na wirasat mein dega, aur wo is se faida uthata hai, phir jab wo mar jae to wo azaad hai."
"1469","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ke paas waleeda aayi jise us ke aaqa ne aag se mara tha ya use is se pahunchaya tha to us ne use azad kya. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke mard ki azadi jaiz nahi jabke us par qarz ho jo us ke maal ko gher le, aur ladke ki azadi jaiz nahi yahan tak ke ehteelam ko pahunche ya ehteelam walon ke darje tak pahunche, aur apne maal mein rok diye gae ki azadi jaiz nahi agarche ehteelam ko pahunche yahan tak ke apna maal wali kare."
"1470","Mujhe Malik ne Usama ke bete Hilal se, unhon ne Yasar ke bete Ata se, unhon ne Hakam ke bete Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah meri aik londi thi jo meri bakriyan charati thi, to main us ke paas aaya jabke bakriyon mein se aik bakri gum ho gayi thi, to maine us se is ke bare mein pucha to us ne kaha ke use bhediye ne khaya, to mujhe us par afsos hua jabke main bani Adam mein se tha to maine us ka chehra thappad mara, aur mujh par gardan hai to kya main use azad karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke Allah kahan hai. To us ne kaha ke aasman mein. To Aap ne farmaya ke main kaun hun. To us ne kaha ke aap Rasulullah hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use azad karo."
"1471","Mujhe Malik ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Masud ke bete Utba ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ubaidullah se riwayat kya ke Ansar mein se aik mard Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas apni siyah londi lekar aaya aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah mujh par momin gardan hai to agar aap use momin samajhte hain to use azad karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke kya tum gawahi deti ho ke Allah ke siwa koi mabood nahi. Us ne kaha ke haan. Aap ne farmaya ke kya tum gawahi deti ho ke Muhammad Rasulullah hain. Us ne kaha ke haan. Aap ne farmaya ke kya tum maut ke baad uthne ka yaqeen rakhti ho. Us ne kaha ke haan. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use azad karo."
"1472","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Maqbari se khabar pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha ke Abu Huraira se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jis par gardan ho ke kya is mein wald-uz-zina azad kare. To Abu Huraira ne kaha ke haan ye us ke liye kafi hoga."
"1473","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein Ansari Ubaid ke bete Fudala se khabar pahunchi jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se they ke un se us mard ke bare mein pucha gaya jis par gardan ho ke kya us ke liye jaiz hai ke wald-uz-zina azad kare. Unhon ne kaha ke haan ye us ke liye kafi hoga."
"1474","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar ke bete Abdullah bin Umar se wajib gardan ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya wo shart se khareedi jae. To unhon ne kaha ke nahi. Malik ne kaha ke wajib gardanon mein jo maine suna yehi sab se behtar hai ke use jo azad kare jo us par wajib hua ho shart par na khareede is par ke use azad kare kyunke jab wo aisa kare to ye mukammal gardan nahi kyunke wo us ki qeemat mein se kam karta hai jo us ke azad karne ki shart rakhta hai. Malik ne kaha ke koi harj nahi ke nafil mein gardan khareede aur shart rakhe ke use azad kare. Malik ne kaha ke wajib gardanon mein jo maine suna sab se behtar hai ke is mein na Nasrani azad kya jae aur na Yahudi, aur is mein na mukatab azad kya jae aur na mudabbar aur na Umm Walad aur na saalon tak azad kiya hua aur na andha, aur koi harj nahi ke Nasrani aur Yahudi aur Majusi nafil mein azad kare kyunke Allah Tabarak wa Taala ne apni kitab mein farmaya ke phir is ke baad ehsan ya fidya, to ehsan azadi hai. Malik ne kaha ke wajib gardanon ka muamla jinka Allah ne kitab mein zikr kya ke is mein momin gardan ke siwa azad na ki jae. Malik ne kaha ke isi tarah kaffaron mein miskeenon ko khilane mein jaiz nahi ke is mein musalmanon ke siwa khilaya jae aur is mein Islam ke ilawa deen par kisi ko na khilaya jae."
"1475","Mujhe Malik ne Amra Ansari ke bete Abi Amra Abdur Rahman se riwayat kya ke us ki walida ne wasiyat karna chaha phir use subah tak moakhir kya aur wo halaak ho gayin jabke us ne azad karne ka irada kya tha, to Abdur Rahman ne kaha ke maine Muhammad ke bete Qasim se kaha ke kya use faida dega ke main us ki taraf se azad karun. To Qasim ne kaha ke Ubada ke bete Saad ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke meri walida halaak ho gain to kya unhein faida dega ke main un ki taraf se azad karun. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan."
"1476","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abu Bakr ke bete Abdur Rahman apni neend mein mar gae jo soe they to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ne un ki taraf se bahut si gardanein azad kin. Malik ne kaha ke is bare mein jo maine suna yehi mujhe sab se pasand hai."
"1477","Mujhe Malik ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se gardanon ke bare mein pucha gaya ke in mein se kaun afzal hai. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qeemat mein sab se mehngi aur apne ghar walon ke nazdeek sab se nafees."
"1478","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke unhon ne wald-uz-zina aur us ki maan ko azad kya."
"1479","Mujhe Malik ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Barira aayi aur kaha ke maine apne ghar walon se nau ooqiya par kitabat ki hai, har saal aik ooqiya, to meri madad karo. To Aaisha ne kaha ke agar tumhare ghar wale pasand karein ke main inhein tumhari taraf se gin dun to gin dungi aur mere liye tumhari wala hogi to aisa karungi. To Barira apne ghar walon ke paas gayi aur un se ye kaha to unhon ne us par inkar kya, to wo apne ghar walon ke paas se aayi jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithe they to us ne Aaisha se kaha ke maine un par ye pesh kya to unhon ne inkar kya magar ke wala un ke liye ho. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye suna aur us se pucha to Aaisha ne Aap ko khabar di to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use lo aur un ke liye wala ki shart rakho kyunke wala to us ke liye hai jo azad kare. To Aaisha ne aisa kya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon mein khade hue aur Allah ki hamd ki aur us ki sana ki phir farmaya ke amma baad, logon ka kya haal hai ke aisi shartein rakhte hain jo Allah ki kitab mein nahi, jo shart Allah ki kitab mein nahi wo batil hai agarche sau shartein hon, Allah ka faisla zyada haq hai aur Allah ki shart zyada mazboot hai, aur wala to us ke liye hai jo azad kare."
"1480","Mujhe Malik ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Momineen ki maan Aaisha ne londi khareedna chaha taake use azad karein to us ke ghar walon ne kaha ke hum use tumhein bechte hain is par ke us ki wala hamare liye hai, to unhon ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to Aap ne farmaya ke ye tumhein na roke kyunke wala to us ke liye hai jo azad kare."
"1481","Mujhe Malik ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ki beti Amra se riwayat kya ke Barira Momineen ki maan Aaisha ke paas madad mangne aayi to Aaisha ne kaha ke agar tumhare ghar wale pasand karein ke main tumhari qeemat in ke liye aik martaba dun aur tumhein azad karun to karungi. To Barira ne is ka zikr apne ghar walon se kya to unhon ne kaha ke nahi magar ke tumhari wala hamare liye ho. Yahya bin Saeed ne kaha ke Amra ne kaha ke Aaisha ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use khareedo aur azad karo kyunke wala to us ke liye hai jo azad kare."
"1482","Mujhe Malik ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wala bechne aur use bakhshne se mana kya."
"1483","Mujhe Malik ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Abu Rabia se riwayat kya ke Awwam ke bete Zubair ne ghulam khareeda aur use azad kya jabke us ghulam ke azaad aurat se bete they, phir jab Zubair ne use azad kya to kaha ke wo mere mawali hain. Aur us ki maan ke mawali ne kaha ke balke wo hamare mawali hain. To unhon ne Affan ke bete Usman se jhagda kya to Usman ne Zubair ke liye un ki wala ka faisla kya."
"1484","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab se us ghulam ke bare mein pucha gaya jis ka bacha azaad aurat se paida hua ho ke un ki wala kis ke liye hai. To Saeed ne kaha ke agar un ka baap mar jae jabke wo ghulam ho aur azad na hua ho to un ki wala un ki maan ke mawali ke liye hai. Malik ne kaha ke is jaisa lian wale ka bacha hai jo mawali mein se ho, us ki maan ke mawali ki taraf mansoob hoga aur wo un ke mawali honge, agar wo mar jae to wo us ke waris honge aur agar wo jinayat kare to us ki diyaat denge, phir agar us ka baap us ka iqrar kare to us se milaya jaega aur us ki wala us ke baap ke mawali ki taraf ho jaegi aur us ki wirasat un ke liye hogi aur us ki diyaat un par hogi aur us ke baap ko hadd lagai jaegi. Malik ne kaha ke isi tarah wo mulaana aurat jo Arab mein se ho, jab us ka shohar jis ne is se lian kya ho us ke bache ka iqrar kare to wo is manzilay jaisa ho jaega siwae is ke ke us ki maan aur us ke maan shareek bhaiyon ki wirasat ke baad us ki baqi wirasat aam musalmanon ke liye hai jab tak wo apne baap se na mile, aur lian wale ke bache ko mawali ne us ki maan ke mawali ki wirasat is se pehle di ke us ka baap us ka iqrar kare kyunke us ka nasab aur na asba tha, phir jab us ka nasab sabit hua to wo apne asba ki taraf ho gaya. Malik ne kaha ke hamare nazdeek ijma wala hukm hai ke ghulam ke bache ke bare mein jo azaad aurat se ho jabke ghulam ka baap azaad ho ke dada ghulam ka baap apne bete ke azaad bachon ki wala kheenchega jo azaad aurat se hon, un ka waris hoga jab tak un ka baap ghulam ho, phir agar un ka baap azad ho jae to wala us ke mawali ki taraf laute gi, aur agar wo mar jae jabke wo ghulam ho to wirasat aur wala dada ke liye hogi, aur ghulam ke do azaad bete hon aur un mein se aik mar jae jabke us ka baap ghulam ho to dada baap ka baap wala aur wirasat kheenchega. Malik ne us londi ke bare mein kaha jo azad ho jabke wo haamila ho aur us ka shohar mamluk ho phir us ka shohar azad ho is se pehle ke wo bacha jane ya bacha janne ke baad, ke jo us ke pet mein tha us ki wala us ke liye hai jo us ki maan ko azad kare kyunke wo bacha riqqat se pahunch chuka tha is se pehle ke us ki maan azad ho, aur wo us ke manzilay mein nahi jo us ki maan azadi ke baad hamal se uthae kyunke jo us ki maan azadi ke baad hamal se uthae jab us ka baap azad ho to wo us ki wala kheenchega. Malik ne us ghulam ke bare mein kaha jo apne aaqa se ijazat mange ke apne ghulam ko azad kare aur us ka aaqa use ijazat de ke azad kiye gae ghulam ki wala."
"1485","Mujhe Malik ne Hazm ke bete Amr ke bete Muhammad ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, unhon ne Hisham ke bete Haris ke bete Abdur Rahman ke bete Abdul Malik se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke Hisham ke bete Aasi halaak ho gae aur apne teen beton ko chhora, do aik maan se aur aik mard dusri se, phir maan shareek dono mein se aik halaak ho gaya aur maal aur mawali chhora to us ke maan baap shareek bhai ne us ka maal aur us ki wala aur us ke mawali wirasat mein pae, phir jo maal aur mawali ki wala ka waris hua tha halaak ho gaya aur apna beta aur apne baap shareek bhai chhora to us ke bete ne kaha ke maine wo rok liya jo mere walid ne maal aur mawali ki wala se roka tha, aur us ke bhai ne kaha ke aisa nahi, balke tum ne maal roka hai aur mawali ki wala nahi, batao agar mera bhai aaj halaak ho jae to kya main us ka waris na hunga. To un dono ne Affan ke bete Usman se jhagda kya to Usman ne us ke bhai ke liye mawali ki wala ka faisla kya."
"1486","Mujhe Malik ne Hazm ke bete Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein khabar di ke un ke walid Usman ke bete Aban ke paas baithe they to Juhaina mein se garoh aur Haris Khazraj ke Banu mein se garoh ne us se jhagda kya, jabke Juhaina mein se aurat Haris Khazraj ke Banu mein se Kulaib ke bete Ibrahim naami mard ke nikah mein thi to wo aurat mar gayi aur maal aur mawali chhora to us ke bete aur shohar ne us ki wirasat pai, phir us ka beta mar gaya to us ke warison ne kaha ke hamare liye mawali ki wala hai, us ke bete ne use rok liya tha, to Juhaina walon ne kaha ke aisa nahi, balke wo hamari sahiba ke mawali hain, phir jab us ka bacha mar jae to hamare liye un ki wala hai aur hum un ke waris hain, to Usman ke bete Aban ne Juhaina walon ke liye mawali ki wala ka faisla kya."
"1487","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Saeed bin Musayyab ne us mard ke bare mein kaha jo halaak ho aur apne teen beton ko chhore aur mawali chhore jinhein us ne khud azad kya tha, phir us ke do bete halaak hon aur aulad chhorein. To Saeed bin Musayyab ne kaha ke mawali ke waris teen mein se baqi honge, phir jab wo halaak ho to us ki aulad aur us ke bhaiyon ki aulad mawali ki wala mein barabar shareek hain."
"1488","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se saiba ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke jis se chahe dosti rakhe, phir agar wo mar jae aur kisi se dosti na rakhi ho to us ki wirasat musalmanon ke liye hai aur us ki diyaat un par hai. Malik ne kaha ke saiba mein jo maine suna sab se behtar hai ke wo kisi se dosti na rakhe aur us ki wirasat musalmanon ke liye hai aur us ki diyaat un par hai. Malik ne us Yahudi aur Nasrani ke bare mein kaha jis ka ghulam musalman ho aur wo use is se pehle azad kare ke us par becha jae ke azad kiye gae ghulam ki wala musalmanon ke liye hai, aur agar Yahudi ya Nasrani is ke baad musalman ho to wala us ki taraf kabhi na laute gi. Unhon ne kaha ke lekin jab Yahudi ya Nasrani ghulam ko un ke deen par azad kare phir azad kiya hua is se pehle musalman ho ke Yahudi ya Nasrani jo use azad kare musalman ho phir jo use azad kare musalman ho to wala us ki taraf laute gi kyunke us ke liye wala sabit ho chuki thi jis din use azad kya. Malik ne kaha ke agar Yahudi ya Nasrani ka musalman beta ho to wo apne Yahudi ya Nasrani baap ke mawali ka waris hoga jab azad kiya hua mawla is se pehle musalman ho ke jo use azad kare musalman ho, aur agar azad kiya hua jab azad kya gaya musalman tha to Nasrani ya Yahudi ke musalman beton ke liye musalman ghulam ki wala mein se kuchh nahi kyunke Yahudi aur na Nasrani ke liye wala hai, to musalman ghulam ki wala musalmanon ki jamaat ke liye hai."
